<title>USA: Ruby Tuesday Inc Q3 March 1 oper shr rises.</title>
<headline>Ruby Tuesday Inc Q3 March 1 oper shr rises.</headline>
<dateline>MOBILE, Ala. 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Oper shr		    $0.46		    $0.36</p>
<p> Oper net		    8,235		    6,325</p>
<p> Revs			172,605		  163,957</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   17,848		   17,520</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)  </p>
<p>			9  MONTHS</p>
<p> Oper shr primary	  $0.99		    $0.72</p>
<p> Oper net		   17,670		   12,623</p>
<p> Revs			486,205		  461,922</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	 17,881		   17,645</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 Q3 and nine-month periods exclude charges of $19.2 million, or $1.09 a share, from impairment and restructuring costs.</p>
<p>1996 Q3 excludes charge of $12.1 million, or $0.68 a share, from discontinued operations.</p>
<p>1996 nine-month period excludes charge of $2.2 million, or $0.13 a share, from discontinued operations.</p>
<p>Discontinued operations represent Morrison Fresh Cooking Inc and Morrison Health Care Inc businesses that were spun off on March 9, 1996.</p>
<p>((--New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
</text>
